od works so well that you don't even"},{"t":170.2,"txt":"need me there telling you what to"},{"t":172,"txt":"change."},{"t":173.4,"txt":"You will be able to hear and make these"},{"t":175.8,"txt":"little tweaks to your body, to your"},{"t":177.6,"txt":"voice that will absolutely transform the"},{"t":180.6,"txt":"way you sound speaking English. You're"},{"t":182.7,"txt":"going to sound so natural and be so easy"},{"t":185.5,"txt":"to understand."},{"t":187.1,"txt":"All Academy students get instant access"},{"t":190,"txt":"to all of our courses, but I recommend"},{"t":192.6,"txt":"everyone start with Essentials. The core"},{"t":195.5,"txt":"course of Essentials is made up of"},{"t":197.6,"txt":"modules, each with several parts. You'll"},{"t":200.2,"txt":"finish one part every day. [music]"},{"t":202.4,"txt":"In each module, we'll go over the method"},{"t":204.8,"txt":"you'll need to master the topic at hand."},{"t":207.9,"txt":"Essentials is built on the concept of"},{"t":210.3,"txt":"micro skills and helping you master"},{"t":212.4,"txt":"them. [music] We've broken the whole big"},{"t":214.9,"txt":"concept of American English down into"},{"t":217.5,"txt":"micro skills so you can do very focused"},{"t":220.8,"txt":"practice and make real progress."},{"t":223.6,"txt":"Throughout the modules, you'll learn the"},{"t":225.4,"txt":"science of why we're working the way we"},{"t":227.9,"txt":"are. We build in so much exposure and"},{"t":231,"txt":"repetition that there's no way not to"},{"t":233.4,"txt":"improve. It ate."},{"t":236.3,"txt":"It ate."},{"t":237.7,"txt":"You'll study clips from our live classes"},{"t":240,"txt":"to understand exactly the changes you"},{"t":242.6,"txt":"need to make to your own voice to sound"},{"t":245.1,"txt":"confident speaking English. I want it"},{"t":247.6,"txt":"flat to be even higher. So, watch this."},{"t":250.6,"txt":"Very flat."},{"t":253.9,"txt":"Very flat. Exactly. And I can't stress"},{"t":258.1,"txt":"it enough. Essentials is built on the"},{"t":260.4,"txt":"play-it-say-it [music] method. Every"},{"t":262.6,"txt":"day, we have you talking. I don't want"},{"t":265,"txt":"you to waste even one day learning about"},{"t":268.1,"txt":"something. This course is not about"},{"t":270.6,"txt":"simply learning something."},{"t":272.5,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":272.6,"txt":">> It's about getting it into your body"},{"t":274.4,"txt":"with the training. There's so much"},{"t":276.8,"txt":"repetition and exposure that you can't"},{"t":279.1,"txt":"help but master these micro skills with"},{"t":281.5,"txt":"the deliberate practice we've given you."},{"t":283.6,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":283.9,"txt":">> The training audio comes in multiple"},{"t":285.7,"txt":"forms, including soundboards, so you can"},{"t":288.3,"txt":"guide your own practice. Hip hops."},{"t":291.4,"txt":"Hip hops."},{"t":295.4,"txt":"And downloadable audio with pauses built"},{"t":298.2,"txt":"in so you can do the training on the go,"},{"t":300.4,"txt":"in your car, when you're going for a"},{"t":302.3,"txt":"walk, and so on. There's variety in the"},{"t":305.1,"txt":"kinds of audio exercises you'll be"},{"t":307.1,"txt":"working with, but they all work towards"},{"t":309.4,"txt":"the same goal, speaking effortlessly"},{"t":312.5,"txt":"without having to think about"},{"t":314.2,"txt":"pronunciation, [music] understanding and"},{"t":316.4,"txt":"building the habit of the American"},{"t":318.2,"txt":"accent. We have visualization exercises"},{"t":321.8,"txt":"and we also teach you how to record"},{"t":323.9,"txt":"yourself and listen to yourself to"},{"t":326.7,"txt":"become your own best coach. The students"},{"t":329.8,"txt":"who've gone through Essentials"},{"t":331.2,"txt":"absolutely love it because they feel the"},{"t":333.4,"txt":"difference in their own fluency and the"},{"t":335.8,"txt":"people around them notice it, too. Once"},{"t":338.6,"txt":"you're done with Essentials, I then"},{"t":340.5,"txt":"recommend that students work on t